 to node2, and mounted at /mnt/shared on node2. Created shared dataops user/group (UID/GID 4500) on both nodes, set ownership dataops:dataops and mode 2770 on both the export and mount point. Opened firewalld for NFS/rpc-bind/mountd on node1. Verified bidirectional read/write consistency (files created on either node show correct dataops:dataops ownership on both sides, root is squashed as expected). Made the mount persistent via /etc/fstab with _netdev. Completed mandatory restart protocol: captured healthy baselines (boot_id, service/mount state, ownership) on both nodes, restarted node1 then node2 one at a time via systemctl reboot, polled until each came back, confirmed boot_id changed on each, and verified NFS server/export and client mount/data fully recovered after each restart, including a final round-trip write test.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected OS and baseline state on node1 and node2 (AlmaLinux 9.6, no dataops user, no nfs-utils)\",\"Created dataops group/user with UID/GID 4500 on node1 and node2\",\"Installed nfs-utils on node1 and node2\",\"Created /srv/nfs/shared on node1 with owner dataops:dataops mode 2770\",\"Created /etc/exports.d/shared.exports exporting /srv/nfs/shared to node2 IP with rw,sync,no_subtree_check,root_squash; enabled and started nfs-server; ran exportfs -ra\",\"Created /mnt/shared on node2 with owner dataops:dataops mode 2770\",\"Opened firewalld ports for nfs, rpc-bind, mountd services on node1 after initial mount hang\",\"Mounted the NFS share on node2 at /mnt/shared and verified type nfs4, correct ownership/mode\",\"Added persistent fstab entry on node2 with _netdev option\",\"Verified bidirectional file creation preserves dataops:dataops ownership across both nodes; confirmed root is squashed\",\"Captured pre-restart baseline (boot_id, service state, exports, mount state) on both nodes\",\"Restarted node1 via systemctl reboot, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, verified nfs-server active, export intact, directory perms intact, and node2's mount self-healed with a successful write\",\"Restarted node2 via systemctl reboot, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, verified mount auto-recovered via fstab, data persisted, and new write succeeded\",\"Cleaned up all test files created during verification\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"dataops user/group with UID/GID 4500 created on node1 and node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-fc8871ebd40f4e1b\",\"cmd-61019bc2fb404f3b\"],\"summary\":\"id dataops shows uid=4500(dataops) gid=4500(dataops) on both nodes\"},{\"requirement\":\"/srv/nfs/shared created on node1 with dataops:dataops mode 2770\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-1bacfb4dd64b4b0b\"],\"summary\":\"ls -ld shows drwxrws---. 2 dataops dataops /srv/nfs/shared\"},{\"requirement\":\"NFS export configured and active on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-ceb3654ab6774d1b\",\"cmd-85af7db02a2d452f\"],\"summary\":\"exportfs -v shows /srv/nfs/shared exported to node2 IP; firewall opened for nfs/rpc-bind/mountd and nfs-server active\"},{\"requirement\":\"NFS share mounted at /mnt/shared on node2 with correct ownership/mode\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2818cb9a06534f16\"],\"summary\":\"mount output shows nfs4 mount from node1; ls -ld shows drwxrws---. 2 dataops dataops\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mount persisted in fstab for node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e217ae63838a4da8\"],\"summary\":\"fstab entry with _netdev added for /mnt/shared\"},{\"requirement\":\"Cross-node write consistency: files created on either node retain dataops:dataops ownership on both sides\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-177fde8b24994bbe\",\"cmd-7546f0a05f49444a\",\"cmd-32fd43fb399d4f80\",\"cmd-6db3fa9fef1f4873\"],\"summary\":\"File created on node2 (from_node2.txt) and node1 (from_node1.txt) both show as dataops:dataops on both nodes via NFS; root access correctly squashed\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b481c47f4a3a4995\"],\"summary\":\"boot_id 8c28f3cd..., nfs-server active, e